WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
- You know what's crazy, you can't have pitbulls in England.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.750
They're considered "dangerous dogs" which is just nonsense.

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:07.240
Look at this thing,

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:10.010
how could you say that this is dangerous?

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.593
(upbeat music)

00:00:24.373 --> 00:00:26.206
No, I probably would--

00:00:27.548 --> 00:00:32.548
Oh, I know.

00:00:33.187 --> 00:00:35.770
(upbeat music)

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.040
We definitely do have a group chat

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:41.520
it's called The Holy Trinity.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:45.493
Jacob and I met at Jacob's audition obviously.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.540
And, ah (mumbles).

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:48.973
Puppies have the best smell.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.950
There's just that puppy smell there's nothing like it.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.790
We instantly became really good friends

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:57.560
and then when I introduced him to my best friend, Harrison

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.773
it was apparent that we were gonna be really good friends

00:00:59.773 --> 00:01:02.240
and that sort of sparked this online thing

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:03.440
called The Holy Trinity.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.460
Sorry that was a terrible answer

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.340
I can't think right now.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.750
I'm too distracted by the cuteness

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.165
of this little puppy right here.

00:01:08.165 --> 00:01:10.748
(upbeat music)

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:13.893
- Chris Pratt.

00:01:13.893 --> 00:01:15.480
Because I get tired and he's so big

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:16.763
he could carry me around.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.463
(upbeat music)

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.420
Sorry again, I forgot the question

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:24.943
I'm just too into these puppies right now.

00:01:25.055 --> 00:01:26.700
Could we have some more puppies in here?

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:28.560
I think we should bring all the other puppies in.

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:30.660
And we should definitely rip up the paper.

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.313
Three movies: Primal Fear,

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.880
I think, My Cousin Vinny

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.630
and Spiderman Homecoming

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.526
so I can reminisce all the good times.

00:01:39.526 --> 00:01:42.109
(upbeat music)

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:46.990
I would choose Atlantis.

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:48.590
And what's the character's name?

00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:50.042
It's like-- whoa!

00:01:50.204 --> 00:01:51.730
It's not the doctor dude the uh--

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:53.903
You are a little nippy one.

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:56.420
Yeah I'd probably play him, the explorer.

00:01:56.438 --> 00:01:59.021
(bouncy music)

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:02.140
Well, I guess you don't really need

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.100
to ask for advice from these guys

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.280
cause you can just watch them work and see how the best

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:07.890
in the business do it.
(puppy whines)

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:08.976
(Tom imitates puppy)

00:02:08.976 --> 00:02:11.559
(bouncy music)

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:15.723
^I would probably be a stunt man.

00:02:18.042 --> 00:02:19.543
Or a carpenter maybe.

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:21.253
All my family are carpenters.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:22.610
Or maybe a puppy wrangler.

00:02:23.324 --> 00:02:25.170
I seem like I'm pretty good at this.

00:02:25.407 --> 00:02:27.990
(groovy music)

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:30.270
Twinkies are pretty weird.

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:32.030
I tried my first Twinkie the other day

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:35.877
and it was disgusting and I'll never eat one again.

00:02:35.877 --> 00:02:37.870
And I actually got a lot of hate online

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:39.423
^for not enjoying a Twinkie.

00:02:41.768 --> 00:02:44.351
(groovy music)

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:50.113
I think "with great power comes great responsibility"

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:52.280
is the best quote I can give you.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:54.750
Hey guys, so this lovely interview today

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.320
the puppies have been brought to us by Angel City Pitbulls

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.740
and you can pick up one of these incredibly cute

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.593
and really naughty pitbull puppies.

00:03:02.847 --> 00:03:05.764
(triumphant music)

00:03:12.236 --> 00:03:14.819
- [Producer] Thank you so much.

00:03:15.575 --> 00:03:17.047
- I don't wanna go, guys.

00:03:17.047 --> 00:03:18.020
(laughter)

